WEBVTT

00:00.270 --> 00:04.940
<b>Police Station</b>

00:11.460 --> 00:14.480
<b>It's started, hasn't it?</b>

00:15.860 --> 00:17.280
<b>Stop talking.</b>

00:17.280 --> 00:19.600
<b>There are less guards around.</b>

00:19.600 --> 00:21.760
<b>It's pretty obvious.</b>

00:23.840 --> 00:28.480
<b>It was for this day that 
I looked near and far...</b>

00:31.770 --> 00:35.490
<b>...for seeds born warped.</b>

00:35.490 --> 00:39.730
<b>Warped seeds worthy of being vessels...</b>

02:23.130 --> 02:25.670
<b>The flames won't go out.</b>

02:28.960 --> 02:32.790
<b>Dad, come to Sekoto Peak 
on your next day off!</b>

02:32.790 --> 02:35.800
<b>It's really cool! Make sure you come!</b>

02:35.800 --> 02:38.500
<b>I might be able to get to Shoto's level!</b>

02:38.500 --> 02:40.870
<b>I don't think I'd lose to All Might, either!</b>

02:42.110 --> 02:46.550
<b>Don't come out, tears! I'm 
not gonna cry, dang it!</b>

02:47.620 --> 02:51.390
<b>Dad, why won't you come?</b>

02:51.390 --> 02:52.660
<b>Dad...</b>

02:53.720 --> 02:56.560
<b>It's so hot! It won't go out!</b>

02:56.560 --> 02:58.690
<b>The flames...</b>

03:03.280 --> 03:06.150
<b>It's hot! So hot!</b>

03:06.460 --> 03:07.620
<b>No...</b>

03:07.620 --> 03:09.740
<b>I don't wanna die!</b>

03:10.300 --> 03:11.960
<b>I haven't...</b>

03:12.490 --> 03:15.240
<b>I haven't...</b>

03:16.020 --> 03:17.800
<b>shown him anything yet...</b>

03:26.680 --> 03:32.600
<b>That was also a child who was born warped.</b>

03:33.970 --> 03:35.020
<b>No...</b>

03:35.810 --> 03:40.250
<b>He wasn't warped. From the start, he was...</b>

03:42.480 --> 03:44.330
<b>all...</b>

03:45.740 --> 03:49.750
<b>Two Flashfires</b>

04:01.450 --> 04:03.010
<b>Where am I?</b>

04:05.680 --> 04:06.600
<b>Sleepyhead, hurry up and get better</b>

04:07.030 --> 04:10.100
<b>I'm alive...?</b>

04:10.100 --> 04:11.590
<b>How...?</b>

04:15.090 --> 04:17.350
<b>Oh, the sleepyhead's awake!</b>

04:18.080 --> 04:21.550
<b>Mr. Sunny! The sleepyhead's awake!</b>

04:21.550 --> 04:23.480
<b>Where am I?</b>

04:23.840 --> 04:26.370
<b>Is this my voice?</b>

04:26.370 --> 04:28.080
<b>This is our home!</b>

04:28.410 --> 04:30.810
<b>You slept for... let's see...</b>

04:30.810 --> 04:33.990
<b>Three years! You slept 
for three whole years!</b>

04:33.990 --> 04:38.240
<b>I just arrived, so I don't know much, 
but that's what Mr. Sunny said.</b>

04:38.720 --> 04:44.500
<b>Three years? What? What happened?</b>

04:44.500 --> 04:47.610
<b>I burned at Sekoto Peak, and...</b>

04:47.610 --> 04:48.680
<b>And...</b>

04:50.420 --> 04:51.580
<b>I have to get home!</b>

04:52.240 --> 04:53.900
<b>You can't do that, sunny!</b>

04:54.220 --> 04:55.250
<b>Why not?</b>

04:55.250 --> 04:58.210
<b>You'll be living here with 
everyone else now, sunny!</b>

04:58.210 --> 05:00.730
<b>This is your new family!</b>

05:00.730 --> 05:02.940
<b>I'm sure it'll feel like home soon!</b>

05:02.940 --> 05:05.340
<b>Wait a minute! I have to get home!</b>

05:05.980 --> 05:06.940
<b>My dad...</b>

05:08.670 --> 05:12.050
<b>He probably just had work 
and couldn't come.</b>

05:12.050 --> 05:14.240
<b>I'm sure he's worried!</b>

05:14.720 --> 05:17.690
<b>I did, and said... terrible things!</b>

05:19.170 --> 05:21.180
<b>I need to apologize to Mom and the others...</b>

05:22.270 --> 05:25.660
<b>I need Dad to see what I can do...</b>

05:26.210 --> 05:28.180
<b>I'm gonna be a he--</b>

05:28.180 --> 05:33.060
<b>Unfortunately, I don't think 
that can happen anymore.</b>

05:33.670 --> 05:37.930
<b>Your burned up body was 
extremely hard to repair.</b>

05:38.280 --> 05:42.180
<b>The missing parts were filled 
in with regenerative tissue.</b>

05:42.660 --> 05:47.240
<b>Your face makes you look like someone 
different, but even so, you survived.</b>

05:47.240 --> 05:50.410
<b>What are you saying? I don't understand...</b>

05:50.850 --> 05:52.210
<b>Someone different?</b>

05:52.730 --> 05:55.900
<b>You can't use your power 
like you did before.</b>

05:55.900 --> 05:58.120
<b>There was damage to your organs.</b>

05:58.120 --> 06:01.230
<b>Your senses, including your sense 
of pain, has been dulled.</b>

06:01.230 --> 06:03.260
<b>Your body is weakened.</b>

06:03.260 --> 06:05.630
<b>It will never go back to how it was before.</b>

06:06.070 --> 06:09.770
<b>We would have liked to receive 
you in full health, too.</b>

06:09.770 --> 06:14.470
<b>We did our best, but 
unfortunately, we failed.</b>

06:21.960 --> 06:25.180
<b>It's hard, isn't it? You poor thing.</b>

06:25.180 --> 06:30.510
<b>But WE might be able to make 
your flames go back to normal!</b>

06:30.510 --> 06:31.610
<b>How about it?</b>

06:31.610 --> 06:36.230
<b>Will you try joining our family 
and learning together with us?</b>

06:36.870 --> 06:38.390
<b>Shut up.</b>

06:38.390 --> 06:39.630
<b>Hm?</b>

06:40.280 --> 06:44.980
<b>I don't want to learn from anyone else.</b>

06:45.920 --> 06:48.420
<b>The only one who can teach me is...</b>

06:49.410 --> 06:51.160
<b>my dad!</b>

06:51.160 --> 06:53.460
<b>Don't do that, sunny!</b>

06:53.460 --> 06:54.300
<b>Be quiet!</b>

06:54.300 --> 06:55.460
<b>Shut up!</b>

06:55.950 --> 06:57.690
<b>Shut up!</b>

07:00.930 --> 07:04.300
<b>It was too late for us to 
lead him to our cause.</b>

07:04.300 --> 07:06.330
<b>He was already too inflamed.</b>

07:06.690 --> 07:09.990
<b>Even the man who ruled over everything</b>

07:09.990 --> 07:14.880
<b>couldn't take advantage of his 
obsession with his father.</b>

07:15.610 --> 07:19.430
<b>In case anything happened 
to Tomura Shigaraki,</b>

07:19.430 --> 07:22.060
<b>we prepared a seedbed of fierce hatred.</b>

07:22.060 --> 07:24.200
<b>Vessels for the demon lord.</b>

07:24.610 --> 07:27.870
<b>Dabi was one of those spares.</b>

07:28.410 --> 07:30.630
<b>And he was a failure.</b>

07:31.470 --> 07:34.530
<b>How far... Wait, what?</b>

07:34.530 --> 07:36.200
<b>What are you trying to say?</b>

07:36.200 --> 07:40.000
<b>That every last thing was 
planned by All For One?</b>

07:40.380 --> 07:43.430
<b>I'm saying that you should be careful.</b>

07:43.970 --> 07:49.280
<b>He lives outside of our discernment.</b>

07:49.880 --> 07:51.420
<b>I have to go back...</b>

07:52.020 --> 07:54.010
<b>I have to go back home...</b>

07:54.810 --> 07:57.220
<b>We left him alone.</b>

07:57.220 --> 07:58.630
<b>Why?</b>

07:58.630 --> 08:05.910
<b>Because Dabi's body was not supposed to 
last more than a month after he woke up.</b>

08:05.910 --> 08:07.250
<b>That's why...</b>

08:07.680 --> 08:10.090
<b>Call me Dabi for now.</b>

08:10.720 --> 08:14.970
<b>I was surprised when the 
broker brought him to us.</b>

08:16.180 --> 08:18.370
<b>Why did he come back?</b>

08:18.370 --> 08:20.460
<b>How was he still alive?</b>

08:20.460 --> 08:26.550
<b>I wanted to hear Dabi's real motive, so 
I arranged for us to be alone together.</b>

08:27.270 --> 08:28.500
<b>Ujiko.</b>

08:29.300 --> 08:30.540
<b>It was you, wasn't it?</b>

08:30.540 --> 08:32.050
<b>You kept me alive.</b>

08:32.380 --> 08:35.730
<b>You realized? I'm glad.</b>

08:35.730 --> 08:38.310
<b>How have you been staying alive since then?</b>

08:38.920 --> 08:41.500
<b>Watching that living corpse</b>

08:42.100 --> 08:46.840
<b>gave me an idea of what 
you guys wanted with me.</b>

08:47.780 --> 08:49.570
<b>I came back</b>

08:49.570 --> 08:52.790
<b>because this is the perfect 
place for a funeral.</b>

08:53.660 --> 08:58.550
<b>That one glance told the whole story.</b>

08:58.850 --> 09:00.800
<b>His body was heading toward death</b>

09:00.800 --> 09:05.640
<b>and he was just holding it together 
with the flames of his resentment.</b>

09:07.230 --> 09:09.020
<b>Hey, Shoto!</b>

09:09.020 --> 09:13.400
<b>I actually went home once.</b>

09:14.140 --> 09:17.350
<b>Even though I was even weaker than before</b>

09:17.350 --> 09:20.270
<b>and had no reason to hope for anything.</b>

09:21.080 --> 09:23.840
<b>I wanted him to look at me again...</b>

09:24.770 --> 09:29.190
<b>I must've hoped that things had changed...</b>

09:29.190 --> 09:31.170
<b>I wanted to see...</b>

09:31.740 --> 09:34.070
<b>The reason I was born...</b>

09:36.030 --> 09:41.900
<b>But the scene that hadn't changed 
in three years told me everything.</b>

09:41.900 --> 09:45.600
<b>That I was a failure with 
no reason for living.</b>

09:45.600 --> 09:48.840
<b>That this family had already 
moved on from me.</b>

09:51.410 --> 09:53.830
<b>When you go past your limits,</b>

09:53.830 --> 09:57.870
<b>it's like everything you've 
ever made gets reversed.</b>

09:58.650 --> 10:02.370
<b>After that, I focused 
on training my flames.</b>

10:02.880 --> 10:05.470
<b>I didn't want to see him 
while I was still weak.</b>

10:06.220 --> 10:08.470
<b>Even when this body started festering 
and pieces were peeling off,</b>

10:08.470 --> 10:10.550
<b>I didn't feel anything.</b>

10:12.240 --> 10:15.200
<b>I could see as many of 
his moves as I wanted.</b>

10:16.710 --> 10:18.750
<b>Shoto, he--</b>

10:19.170 --> 10:22.590
<b>You were expecting to die--from the start!</b>

10:23.520 --> 10:25.910
<b>Whenever he protected the town,</b>

10:25.910 --> 10:28.050
<b>whenever he became more famous,</b>

10:28.490 --> 10:31.140
<b>my heart pounded.</b>

10:32.050 --> 10:37.310
<b>Ever since I died, and Dabi was born, I--</b>

10:38.640 --> 10:39.940
<b>Heat is...</b>

10:40.310 --> 10:44.900
<b>energy that comes from all 
living things when they move.</b>

10:45.320 --> 10:49.540
<b>All For One, with his 
desire to live forever,</b>

10:49.540 --> 10:53.050
<b>could not have this heat, which 
only moves toward death.</b>

10:53.550 --> 10:59.050
<b>The flames of death of a monomaniac 
that even the demon lord abandoned.</b>

10:59.860 --> 11:04.720
<b>I will burn up everything he holds dear.</b>

11:04.720 --> 11:08.260
<b>That's the proof of my birth!</b>

11:08.800 --> 11:13.120
<b>I told you, I won't let you, stupid brother!</b>

11:19.610 --> 11:21.990
<b>Shoto Todoroki</b>

11:24.410 --> 11:27.190
<b>Ultimate move, Flashfire Fist.</b>

11:28.030 --> 11:34.180
<b>Increasing your own heat as high as 
possible and storing it or releasing it.</b>

11:34.900 --> 11:38.460
<b>The ultimate fire move that 
a young Endeavor attained.</b>

11:38.890 --> 11:44.170
<b>As he mastered this move in his quest 
for power, he learned his own limits.</b>

11:44.170 --> 11:45.760
<b>And the fire...</b>

11:46.490 --> 11:51.550
<b>produced a mirage that warped 
the view he'd set his eyes on.</b>

11:52.150 --> 11:54.100
<b>Okay, okay.</b>

11:54.100 --> 11:56.930
<b>I've cheered up after telling you!</b>

11:57.340 --> 11:59.690
<b>Thanks for listening!</b>

12:00.260 --> 12:03.060
<b>He's getting hotter faster!</b>

12:03.060 --> 12:04.860
<b>There's absolutely no hesitation!</b>

12:05.170 --> 12:10.460
<b>Even having to fight you without 
Dad here is pretty good kindling!</b>

12:10.890 --> 12:13.870
<b>I will be the one to stop you!</b>

12:14.260 --> 12:16.300
<b>Don't get the wrong idea.</b>

12:16.300 --> 12:19.870
<b>I have thoughts about you, too!</b>

12:20.830 --> 12:24.620
<b>I started by getting my weakened fire back.</b>

12:24.620 --> 12:27.330
<b>I at least knew how to 
increase my firepower.</b>

12:27.980 --> 12:30.170
<b>He said my firepower was greater than his.</b>

12:30.170 --> 12:32.800
<b>That became my encouragement.</b>

12:33.670 --> 12:37.500
<b>My dulled senses removed my limits.</b>

12:37.500 --> 12:40.350
<b>I learned how to release 
the flames by watching.</b>

12:40.860 --> 12:42.820
<b>Flashfire Fist!</b>

12:44.580 --> 12:47.630
<b>You like All Might, Shoto?!</b>

12:48.040 --> 12:49.120
<b>It's coming!</b>

12:49.120 --> 12:51.240
<b>Hell Spider!</b>

12:51.700 --> 12:53.150
<b>It's hot!</b>

12:53.550 --> 12:55.370
<b>Is this Endeavor's move?!</b>

12:57.390 --> 13:00.280
<b>Even so, it's bigger and sloppier!</b>

13:00.870 --> 13:04.520
<b>I don't even know what Toya likes.</b>

13:05.580 --> 13:07.010
<b>Todoroki!</b>

13:13.860 --> 13:15.720
<b>Shoto! Are you ready?</b>

13:16.150 --> 13:17.130
<b>Yeah, here I go!</b>

13:20.400 --> 13:21.210
<b>He's fast!</b>

13:21.210 --> 13:23.040
<b>Was Hell Spider a distraction?</b>

13:23.540 --> 13:26.590
<b>There's one thing I want to ask you, Shoto--</b>

13:26.590 --> 13:29.560
<b>Just what expression did 
you have on your face...</b>

13:32.280 --> 13:36.740
<b>...as you hid inside U.A. 
with those scared civilians?</b>

13:36.740 --> 13:40.660
<b>As Endeavor's son and Dabi's brother!</b>

13:40.980 --> 13:44.580
<b>You're like the congealed broth of calamity!</b>

13:45.100 --> 13:50.470
<b>It's that shamelessness, Shoto!</b>

13:50.470 --> 13:51.630
<b>Shoto!</b>

13:51.630 --> 13:53.890
<b>In terms of firepower, he's 
stronger than Endeavor!</b>

13:54.480 --> 13:56.940
<b>But if he keeps moving like that--</b>

13:57.690 --> 14:02.130
<b>Despite being raised in the best 
environment with a body ideal for fire,</b>

14:02.130 --> 14:03.610
<b>you depend on others!</b>

14:03.930 --> 14:06.030
<b>Even though you were born with everything,</b>

14:06.030 --> 14:08.100
<b>you didn't try to be your full potential!</b>

14:08.450 --> 14:12.380
<b>If no one else is gonna say it, then I will!</b>

14:13.730 --> 14:16.150
<b>You're an aimless, half-baked doll!</b>

14:17.540 --> 14:20.550
<b>You won't amount to anything!</b>

14:20.940 --> 14:24.290
<b>Jetburn!</b>

14:32.420 --> 14:33.980
<b>Yeah...</b>

14:33.980 --> 14:35.760
<b>You're right.</b>

14:36.390 --> 14:40.550
<b>I was a fool... who took detours... 
couldn't make up my mind...</b>

14:41.190 --> 14:43.150
<b>That's me.</b>

14:46.180 --> 14:48.820
<b>The heat's being neutralized?</b>

14:49.230 --> 14:52.710
<b>I thought you could only see Dad.</b>

14:54.040 --> 14:57.850
<b>I'm glad you were looking at me, too.</b>

14:59.190 --> 15:01.240
<b>Wanting to catch up to the others,</b>

15:01.670 --> 15:04.530
<b>I found this while training--</b>

15:06.350 --> 15:07.760
<b>Flashfire...</b>

15:09.610 --> 15:12.540
<b>I created this move myself.</b>

15:13.020 --> 15:15.550
<b>It's a move meant to stop you.</b>

15:16.530 --> 15:20.290
<b>Shoto, are you sure you won't 
reconsider where you're stationed?</b>

15:20.290 --> 15:22.470
<b>What about All For One?</b>

15:23.050 --> 15:24.960
<b>Like how, of the remaining heroes,</b>

15:24.960 --> 15:28.490
<b>the only one who can put up a 
fight against that is you--</b>

15:28.980 --> 15:31.340
<b>And how Midoriya needs to stop Shigaraki--</b>

15:32.090 --> 15:35.190
<b>My power is the one best to face Toya.</b>

15:35.190 --> 15:36.550
<b>And that's what I want to do.</b>

15:37.280 --> 15:39.040
<b>It's my duty.</b>

15:39.620 --> 15:41.200
<b>It's OURS.</b>

15:41.550 --> 15:43.930
<b>We all need to do what we can do.</b>

15:44.530 --> 15:48.550
<b>And together, we will stop 
Toya and the other villains.</b>

15:50.590 --> 15:53.940
<b>As your half-baked brother, I'll say this--</b>

15:54.510 --> 15:58.210
<b>Dad was crazy! Our family was hopeless!</b>

15:58.830 --> 16:03.200
<b>Even so, you're the one 
who chose to burn people!</b>

16:04.070 --> 16:07.530
<b>You're going to fight against Dabi...?</b>

16:07.530 --> 16:10.450
<b>Everyone, make sure you're 
out in 30 minutes!</b>

16:10.810 --> 16:12.490
<b>It's what I wanted.</b>

16:12.490 --> 16:13.900
<b>Don't worry.</b>

16:14.390 --> 16:18.080
<b>My dad will probably grumble about not 
being able to keep his promise, though.</b>

16:18.650 --> 16:22.570
<b>But if not being able to fight Dabi 
is part of Dad's punishment,</b>

16:22.570 --> 16:24.950
<b>Hawks and the others made 
the right decision.</b>

16:28.010 --> 16:30.090
<b>Dabi is our family's cross to bear.</b>

16:30.690 --> 16:36.090
<b>Besides, it's something I have to 
do to get to where I want to be.</b>

16:38.310 --> 16:42.230
<b>That's why this move is what I'll 
use to get over that wall.</b>

16:42.730 --> 16:45.230
<b>Is this what you were saying 
you almost got the hang of?</b>

16:46.250 --> 16:50.380
<b>It's a little different from Flashfire Fist!</b>

16:50.380 --> 16:53.740
<b>Oh right, you left, so you don't know.</b>

16:53.740 --> 16:56.660
<b>This part's not hot even if you touch it.</b>

16:56.660 --> 16:58.580
<b>See? Isn't it amazing?</b>

16:58.580 --> 17:01.910
<b>It's hard to maintain, though, 
so it goes away pretty fast.</b>

17:01.910 --> 17:04.420
<b>I'm still better in actual battle!</b>

17:04.420 --> 17:05.660
<b>So you're a small fry!</b>

17:08.730 --> 17:10.740
<b>I took the essence of Flashfire</b>

17:11.580 --> 17:16.450
<b>and manifest my right and left sides at the 
same time with my heart at the center.</b>

17:17.000 --> 17:20.240
<b>The hot and cold blood 
circulate through my body</b>

17:20.240 --> 17:22.360
<b>and bring equilibrium to both sides.</b>

17:24.930 --> 17:27.520
<b>The hot and cold mix together...</b>

17:27.520 --> 17:31.020
<b>They're like cold flames!</b>

17:32.100 --> 17:35.850
<b>Dad wanted Ice to lower his body's heat.</b>

17:36.540 --> 17:38.330
<b>But I'm doing the opposite.</b>

17:38.970 --> 17:41.450
<b>I'm doing this so I myself can accept</b>

17:42.080 --> 17:44.540
<b>the reason I was born into that family.</b>

17:45.290 --> 17:48.590
<b>It's YOUR power, isn't it?!</b>

17:50.070 --> 17:53.110
<b>Midoriya, it's my power.</b>

17:53.780 --> 17:54.890
<b>Thanks.</b>

17:57.770 --> 18:02.430
<b>Don't take the lives of 
any more innocent people!</b>

18:03.860 --> 18:05.590
<b>Flashfire Fist...</b>

18:06.290 --> 18:07.380
<b>Phosphor!</b>

18:10.620 --> 18:12.840
<b>Icebound Crash...</b>

18:12.840 --> 18:14.630
<b>Coldflame's Pale Blade!</b>

18:15.390 --> 18:19.190
<b>If you need to vent, we'll 
take everything you've got!</b>

18:19.610 --> 18:23.400
<b>It might help you cool your head!</b>

18:27.380 --> 18:32.790
<b>A body that can withstand this intense 
heat and the power to cool my flames.</b>

18:33.600 --> 18:37.050
<b>There's no one better than 
you to face me, huh?</b>

18:37.370 --> 18:41.080
<b>And you talk about right 
and wrong choices...</b>

18:41.080 --> 18:43.670
<b>I knew it!</b>

18:43.670 --> 18:47.640
<b>Even though we're brothers sharing the 
same blood, we ended up so different!</b>

18:50.450 --> 18:52.700
<b>It went out! I have to start it again!</b>

18:53.080 --> 18:56.900
<b>Warped rails will never 
cross straight paths.</b>

18:56.900 --> 18:59.320
<b>It's the limit of superhuman society!</b>

18:59.770 --> 19:03.110
<b>That describes us!</b>

19:03.760 --> 19:05.840
<b>We're going down parallel tracks now!</b>

19:06.240 --> 19:09.500
<b>Burn up and die! For our sakes!</b>

19:13.970 --> 19:15.290
<b>Shoto...</b>

19:15.870 --> 19:18.970
<b>...you said it!</b>

19:22.610 --> 19:25.430
<b>This is so hot it burns even me...</b>

19:26.120 --> 19:27.630
<b>Sorry...!</b>

19:28.650 --> 19:30.110
<b>I told you...</b>

19:30.690 --> 19:32.950
<b>It's a waste of energy...</b>

19:33.600 --> 19:35.360
<b>Thank you very much!</b>

19:36.270 --> 19:39.370
<b>Even a simple phrase like this...</b>

19:41.320 --> 19:44.520
<b>There was so much I had to go 
back and pick up on this path...</b>

19:46.760 --> 19:50.080
<b>The blood and past made from greed...</b>

19:51.250 --> 19:53.490
<b>It's okay for YOU to be one.</b>

19:54.400 --> 19:56.780
<b>You don't have to be bound by your blood.</b>

19:57.760 --> 19:59.620
<b>It's okay for you to become</b>

19:59.620 --> 20:01.100
<b>who you want to be.</b>

20:02.550 --> 20:04.920
<b>Ever since I realized that,</b>

20:04.920 --> 20:07.520
<b>it seemed like unlike me, who had stopped,</b>

20:07.930 --> 20:10.550
<b>everyone had already gone on ahead.</b>

20:12.860 --> 20:17.050
<b>But they were always right there.</b>

20:22.120 --> 20:25.780
<b>Class A didn't leave anyone behind.</b>

20:27.550 --> 20:30.040
<b>They always made me feel safe.</b>

20:31.090 --> 20:33.450
<b>Your ultimate moves are symbols of you!</b>

20:33.780 --> 20:36.950
<b>Let people know what you can 
do through your moves.</b>

20:37.490 --> 20:41.290
<b>Store it up and fire. Condense your power.</b>

20:41.870 --> 20:43.150
<b>Store it up and...</b>

21:02.940 --> 21:05.880
<b>Our paths will cross, even if it's forced.</b>

21:07.690 --> 21:08.790
<b>So...</b>

21:09.650 --> 21:10.960
<b>please stop.</b>

21:13.170 --> 21:15.250
<b>Great Glacial Aegir!</b>

23:20.000 --> 23:22.000
<b>Preview</b>

23:21.150 --> 23:22.540
<b>Here's the preview.</b>

23:22.970 --> 23:25.110
<b>Todoroki stopped Dabi!</b>

23:25.520 --> 23:28.340
<b>That good news was relayed 
to the other heroes,</b>

23:28.340 --> 23:30.610
<b>and they gathered momentum for a victory.</b>

23:31.280 --> 23:33.710
<b>In addition, at the site 
of the Gunga Villa,</b>

23:34.050 --> 23:38.790
<b>Endeavor and Hawks are fighting a battle 
to the death with All For One.</b>

23:39.870 --> 23:41.920
<b>Next time, "Extras."</b>

23:42.510 --> 23:45.970
<b>Endeavor's flames that have 
overcome the past surge up.</b>

23:45.980 --> 23:49.980
<b>Next time: Extras</b>

23:46.720 --> 23:48.120
<b>Go beyond!</b>

23:48.120 --> 23:49.510
<b>Plus Ultra!</b>
